WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.800
Welcome to the Healthcare Paradox, the podcast that goes inside America's healthcare system

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:13.480
to find out what is really going on.

00:00:13.480 --> 00:00:19.680
Episode after episode, we analyze the scenarios that matter using the data from HHS and CMS

00:00:19.680 --> 00:00:25.120
and validating what the numbers say with the people who live them every day, providers,

00:00:25.120 --> 00:00:29.880
beneficiaries, and stakeholders across the system because the truth about healthcare

00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:34.720
is not in the talking points, it is in the data and in the voices of the people the system

00:00:34.720 --> 00:00:36.400
is supposed to serve.

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:41.000
From Puerto Rico to every jurisdiction the rules treat differently, we follow the facts

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:45.960
wherever they lead, and as new events unfold we will be right here to break them down

00:00:45.960 --> 00:00:49.200
for you always with the interesting topics.

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:53.080
So here is my promise, no spin, no excuses.

00:00:53.080 --> 00:00:56.960
Just the truth about the system and the solutions that can fix it.

00:00:56.960 --> 00:01:04.160
Now go find our episodes on Spotify, Apple Podcasts, Amazon Music, iHeartRadio and YouTube.

00:01:04.160 --> 00:01:05.880
The Healthcare Paradox starts now.
